erged_at":"2025-10-29T18:21:36Z"},"body":"Fixes #112146\r\n\r\nThis is a relatively minor fix ~~for an undocumented bug~~. I've got a few more I want to do PRs for too, but I figure it's best to do them separately rather than all together.\r\n\r\nIn my test scenario, my terrain is setup like so:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"301\" height=\"292\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e27ed225-b47e-48cf-86a2-109233023a28\" />\r\n\r\nif I draw this with the rectangle tool then erase 2 cells...\r\n\r\n<img width=\"213\" height=\"211\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8adba6cf-9c77-46fc-a1bd-3ae3886833e4\" />\r\n\r\nThis is what happens currently\r\n\r\n<img width=\"198\" height=\"201\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/517e0c4b-a630-4b7b-b8d5-1a279b2bc6d1\" />\r\n\r\nThe expected outcome should be something like this. This PR changes the behaviour to this.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"210\" height=\"208\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ce09c69-d421-4352-85ae-556598e879ed\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"publ